   "subject": "Micro_USA Issue",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi All,</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Wondering if anyone has had issues with micro_usa recently? My code was working on Monday, but after updating my packages this morning it seems like not even the tutorial code will work. All the other microclim models seem to be working fine, but the micro_usa model is consistently returning the error: <br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\"></span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\"></span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"></span><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(222,222,222);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\">Error in RNetCDF::<a href=\"http://open.nc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://open.nc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240153529000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3GNKqjgqkBv2kA92QD-Jpv\">open.nc</a>(paste0(baseurl, &quot;tmmn_1979_CurrentYear_CONUS.nc&quot;)) : \r\n  NetCDF: Not a valid data type or _FillValue type mismatch</span></span></pre></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Wanted to know if anyone else has run into this issue.<br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><div>Thank you!<br></div><div><br></div><div>Connor<br>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">M.S. <font face=\"times new roman, serif\">Biology</font></span><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">, </font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">Austin Peay State University 2022</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">B.S. </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">Wildlife and Fisheries Ecology and Conservation &amp; GIS Technologies. </span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:small\">UMass Amherst College of Natural Sciences 2020</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:small\">He/Him/His</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M_q6r4o0CQAJ",
   "from": "NicheMapR",
   "author": "6cec8ea3702ece93",
   "date": "2021-09-18T03:52:33Z",
   "subject": "Re: Micro_USA Issue",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Hi Connor,</div><div><br>That&#39;s odd. I just tried</div><div>micro &lt;- micro_usa()</div><div>and there was no problem.</div><div><br></div><div>Try:</div><div>baseurl &lt;- &quot;<a href=\"http://thredds.northwestknowledge.net:8080/thredds/dodsC/agg_met_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://thredds.northwestknowledge.net:8080/thredds/dodsC/agg_met_&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240153530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38CZbX6Lx_oI58yzaY_Zol\">http://thredds.northwestknowledge.net:8080/thredds/dodsC/agg_met_</a>&quot;<br>nc &lt;- RNetCDF::<a href=\"http://open.nc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://open.nc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240153530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25Gf5gOr3DHYxg3hUB8sW0\">open.nc</a>(paste0(baseurl, &quot;tmmn_1979_CurrentYear_CONUS.nc&quot;))</div><div><br></div><div>That&#39;s the bit that&#39;s causing the error on your system. There might be a problem with your installation of RNetCDF if it fails.</div><div><br></div><div>All the best,<br>Mike<br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Saturday, September 18, 2021 at 7:47:23 AM UTC+10 <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">connorh...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi All,</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Wondering if anyone has had issues with micro_usa recently? My code was working on Monday, but after updating my packages this morning it seems like not even the tutorial code will work. All the other microclim models seem to be working fine, but the micro_usa model is consistently returning the error: <br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\"></span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\"></span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"></span><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(222,222,222);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\">Error in RNetCDF::<a href=\"http://open.nc\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://open.nc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793240153530000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25Gf5gOr3DHYxg3hUB8sW0\">open.nc</a>(paste0(baseurl, &quot;tmmn_1979_CurrentYear_CONUS.nc&quot;)) : \r\n  NetCDF: Not a valid data type or _FillValue type mismatch</span></span></pre></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Wanted to know if anyone else has run into this issue.<br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></div><div>Thank you!<br></div><div><br></div><div>Connor<br>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">M.S. <font face=\"times new roman, serif\">Biology</font></span><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">, </font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">Austin Peay State University 2022</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">B.S. </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">Wildlife and Fisheries Ecology and Conservation &amp; GIS Technologies. </span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:small\">UMass Amherst College of Natural Sciences 2020</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:small\">He/Him/His</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
